course: dictionary
lesson: 13117
title: Floral: flowers in words and patterns
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words describe how things look, feel or smell, and «floral» is one of them. Floral means made of flowers, or decorated with a pattern of flowers. «Mia wore a floral dress to the summer party.» The dress has flowers printed on it, so floral describes what the dress looks like.
explain: Floral can also describe a smell. «The room smelled sweet, with a floral scent from the lavender.» You cannot see a smell, so look at the clues around the word: the room smelled sweet, and lavender is a flower. Floral here means smelling like flowers.
explain: To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence. If «the dress has flowers printed on it» fits the first sentence, you have it right. Look for clue words like dress, curtains or scent to find out what floral is describing.
fact: Floral means made of flowers or decorated with a pattern of flowers.
fact: «Floral» can also describe a smell like flowers.
fact: A floral pattern is a design of flowers, such as roses and daisies, used on dresses, curtains and wallpaper.
fact: Floral displays are arrangements of flowers, and they often decorate weddings and funerals.
fact: In science, floral parts are the parts of a flower: petals, stamens and carpels.
exercise: «Mia wore a floral dress to the summer party.» What does floral mean here? | *Decorated with a pattern of flowers | Very hot | Shiny like glass | Made of metal
exercise: «The curtains had a bright floral pattern of roses and daisies.» Find and copy one word that means decorated with flowers. | bright | pattern | *floral | curtains
exercise: In science, floral parts are the parts of a flower. Which of these is a floral part? | Bricks | *Petals | Wheels | Branches
test: «The wedding tables were decorated with floral displays.» What are floral displays? | Plates and cups | Chairs for the guests | *Arrangements of flowers | Tables made of wood
test: «The room smelled sweet, with a floral scent from the lavender.» What does floral suggest about the scent? | *Smelling like flowers | Smelling of smoke | Smelling of rain and mud
exam: Sam says a floral shirt has stripes. What does floral really mean here? | Striped | Made of wood | Plain and white | *Decorated with a pattern of flowers
